  "body": "`mcp`, `script` and `cli` already sit strictly above the rest of `app` (nothing in app imports them). Move them to their own crate with their 20 test files, so MCP work no longer rebuilds and relinks the other app suites.\n\nNote: MCP issues are P1 by AGENTS.md; this one is build structure, not an MCP feature, and is filed P2 as the research proposed - the maintainer may raise it.\n\nDone means: `camcraft-app` no longer contains the three modules; their tests move with them; the `camcraft-cli` binary and the ui build behave the same; the camcraft-mcp skill's paths are updated.\n\nLists, counts and evidence: the research comment on #919 (https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/919#issuecomment-6808141599).\n\nPart of #919.\n",
